<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT COLOMBIA 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT COLOMBIA 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia beat Colombia 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a Copa America quarter-final Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bolivia - Marco Etcheverry (3), Erwin Sanchez (23)</p>
<p>Colombia - Herman Gaviria (61)</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
